@startuml
title GeoVisLM Terrain Pipeline Sequence

actor User
participant "CLI Runner" as CLI
participant "GIS Terrain Module" as Terrain
database "Raw Data" as Raw
database "Processed Outputs" as Outputs
participant "QGIS" as QGIS
participant "Report Generator\nFuture" as Reports

User -> CLI: run terrain analysis with DEM path
CLI -> Raw: read DEM GeoTIFF
Raw --> CLI: DEM path

CLI -> Terrain: load_dem()
Terrain --> CLI: DEM array, profile, transform, CRS

CLI -> Terrain: calculate_slope_degrees()
Terrain --> CLI: slope raster

CLI -> Terrain: calculate_hillshade()
Terrain --> CLI: hillshade raster

CLI -> Terrain: classify_slope_risk()
Terrain --> CLI: risk raster

CLI -> Outputs: save slope_degrees.tif
CLI -> Outputs: save hillshade.tif
CLI -> Outputs: save terrain_risk.tif

User -> QGIS: open generated GeoTIFFs
QGIS -> Outputs: load map layers

CLI -> Reports: generate summary report later
Reports -> Outputs: save report

@enduml
